msgid "The configuration file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/config_file.md:3
msgid ""
"YAML, and the weakest source above the built-in defaults. It is where the"
" settings that do not change between runs belong — the repository, the "
"database, the lists, the output shape — so that a command line only has "
"to say what is different this time."
msgstr ""

